Package: MIDS
Title: Multi-Frame Individual Distinction by Size
Version: 1
Authors@R: 
    person("Hayden", "Swift", email = "hayden.swift@newcastle.edu.au", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tools for applying Multi-frame Individual Distinction by Size (MIDS)
    to stereo-video observations. The package estimates distinct individuals by
    comparing fish length measurements across frames while accounting for
    measurement precision and uncertainty.
